| Feb 9 | Mon | 8 | Continued **Testing** — wrote API integration tests for all endpoints (measurements, fit checks, wardrobe). Performed manual end-to-end testing of complete user flows. **Security hardening** — implemented input validation schemas, SQL injection prevention, rate limiting middleware. |
| Feb 10 | Tue | 8 | Completed **Security** — built centralized [cors_config.py](file:///d:/3Dmodel/api/cors_config.py), JWT token rotation, secure headers. Frontend: XSS prevention, Content Security Policy. Infrastructure: environment variable validation, [.gitignore](file:///d:/3Dmodel/api/.gitignore) cleanup, HTTPS enforcement. **Performance** — implemented lazy loading, code splitting, API response caching, GZip compression. |
