| Feb 12 | Thu | 8 | Built mobile **Authentication screens** — Login, Register, Welcome, and Forgot Password. Created Zustand auth store for state management. Set up the navigation structure — bottom tab navigator (Home, Scan, Wardrobe, Fashion, Profile) and stack navigators for sub-screens. |
